{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient mountain range plagued by thunderstorms. A platoon of soldiers vanished into thin air. One deserter.\u00a0Whispered rumors of monsters. Explore a haunted mansion and the surrounding countryside, investigating the monsters hiding within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a sergeant sent to investigate a missing platoon of soldiers who had been stationed in the remote\u00a0Martense mansion. You soon discover the truth to the rumors of these haunted mountains and must struggle to survive and escape the coming thunderstorms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lurking Fear is a survival horror adaptation of the original Lovecraft story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually reloading guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black powder guns that obscure your vision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures that use stealth to hunt you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and characters </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925810?t=1768598993","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925810?t=1768598993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925810/e0e581baf4c945d3a44eb33b488c3422b667011f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768598993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925810/e0e581baf4c945d3a44eb33b488c3422b667011f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768598993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo S